{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/c33ab5aa7a8fcea80e682e2aa2112918.avif?t=1772301519\" width=800 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You</strong> wake up as a ghost, with no memory of who you were or how you died. The only clue to your past is the <strong>empty suit of armour you now possess</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore an abandoned castle and piece together your memories, you\u2019ll uncover your tale: A tale of broken promises, regret, and bonds that last beyond death.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But your story doesn\u2019t have to die with you.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/463a68a7e5f2557f8952460fd4c33805.avif?t=1772301519\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras_big/463a68a7e5f2557f8952460fd4c33805.avif?t=1772301519 width=800 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Winter Knight</i> is an <strong>atmospheric Gothic visual novel</strong> that features:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tA <strong>melancholy story</strong> where you play as a ghostly knight haunting a suit of armour.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t<strong>Point and click</strong> segments that let you explore a lonely castle.* </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t<strong>Hand-drawn artwork</strong> that captures a dark fairy tale feel. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tA <strong>pensive piano soundtrack</strong> that subtly shifts depending on where and what you examine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t<strong>Multiple endings</strong> to uncover: Will you remained trapped in your armour, or finally find peace?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*Accessibility note:</strong> Instead of clicking, you can hover over objects and hit -Enter- to interact with them. Text can be advanced with -Space- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/be702997800ec18ba90a23fcc9287e40.poster.avif?t=1772301519\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/be702997800ec18ba90a23fcc9287e40.webm?t=1772301519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/be702997800ec18ba90a23fcc9287e40.mp4?t=1772301519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/d2222f9006cddf530ad158e662152c28.avif?t=1772301519\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras_big/d2222f9006cddf530ad158e662152c28.avif?t=1772301519 width=800 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Winter Knight is <strong>100% human made and crafted with love</strong> by a solo developer who painted each frame, recorded and edited every track, typed every line of code and constantly agonised over word choices. Thank you so much for checking out this game and huge labour of love!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A special thank you to the people who helped make this project possible:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wanpans Armoury</strong> for providing armour foley, playtesting and acting as a consultant for medieval arms, armour and general knowledge. There are many, many breaks from reality in this fantasy game, none of which are their fault.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cobaye</strong> and <strong>Sammy L.</strong> for playtesting and moral support.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ArcanaXIX</strong> for the haunting cello performances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>n3ur0515 (Neur)</strong> for editing the trailer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And friends and family for their support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/e99eb25b33862fedfdc99b11a289ab74.poster.avif?t=1772301519\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/e99eb25b33862fedfdc99b11a289ab74.webm?t=1772301519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/e99eb25b33862fedfdc99b11a289ab74.mp4?t=1772301519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/a65bc9c4b1fa7e177aa1f65496045f92.avif?t=1772301519\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras_big/a65bc9c4b1fa7e177aa1f65496045f92.avif?t=1772301519 width=800 height=103 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2768420?t=1772301519","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772301519","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/6dc6051cf9f