an></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Winter Knight</i> is an <strong>atmospheric Gothic visual novel</strong> that features:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tA <strong>melancholy story</strong> where you play as a ghostly knight haunting a suit of armour.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t<strong>Point and click</strong> segments that let you explore a lonely castle.* </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t<strong>Hand-drawn artwork</strong> that captures a dark fairy tale feel. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tA <strong>pensive piano soundtrack</strong> that subtly shifts depending on where and what you examine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t<strong>Multiple endings</strong> to uncover: Will you remained trapped in your armour, or finally find peace?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*Accessibility note:</strong> Instead of clicking, you can hover over objects and hit -Enter- to interact with them. Text can be advanced with -Space- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/be702997800ec18ba90a23fcc9287e40.poster.avif?t=1772301519\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/be702997800ec18ba90a23fcc9287e40.webm?t=1772301519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/be702997800ec18ba90a23fcc9287e40.mp4?t=1772301519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/d2222f9006cddf530ad158e662152c28.avif?t=1772301519\" data-bi